Recommends: pipewire-pulse, libspa-0.2-bluetooth, ffmpeg
Description: Pipe analog audio to Bluetooth, AirPlay, or Sonos
 pi-piper captures analog line-in (RCA / 3.5mm via a USB sound card or audio
 HAT) on a Raspberry Pi or OrangePi and streams it to a Bluetooth speaker,
 an AirPlay receiver, or a Sonos zone. Includes a CLI for pairing and
 device selection plus a systemd service.
